OL,3,GNEWSASouth West Water has sharpest rise
OL,4,Ain complaints
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe number of customer complaints
OL,7,Freceived by South West Water (SWW) has
OL,8,Fmore than doubled in the last year -
OL,9,Fthe sharpest rise across all water and
OL,10,Fsewerage companies in the country, new
OL,11,Ffigures show.
OL,13,FComplaints made by households directly
OL,14,Fto all water companies rose across the
OL,15,Fboard by 56% in 2025-26 - with
OL,16,Fcomplaints to SWW surging by 153%.
OL,18,FMeanwhile, both SWW and Thames Water
OL,19,Fwere rated "poor" by the consumer
OL,20,Fwatchdog, in regard to the number of
OL,21,Fcomplaints received, and how the firms
OL,22,Fhandled them.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
